  "description": "This walk takes you along a section of the North Downs Way from Wye to Chilham in Kent. The route runs for a distance of about 7 miles, following the waymarked footpath west and then north from Wye. On the way you will pass along the peaceful woodland paths in King's Wood before some pleasant countryside trails past Godmersham Park. You can continue your walking on the Chilham to Canterbury Walk .",
